{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2023-04-13 10:45:00', 'title': 'SAUL VAN BEURDEN NAMED CEO OF CONSUMER & SMALL BUSINESS BANKING FOR WELLS FARGO; MARY MACK TO RETIRE; TRACY KERRINS NAMED HEAD OF TECHNOLOGY', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MARY MACK WILL RETIRE FROM THE COMPANY THIS SUMMER AND SAUL VAN BEURDEN, HEAD OF TECHNOLOGY AT WELLS FARGO, WILL SUCCEED MACK AS CEO OF CONSUMER & SMALL BUSINESS BANKING (CSBB), EFFECTIVE MAY 15. VAN BEURDEN WILL CONTINUE TO REPORT TO CEO CHARLIE SCHARF AND WILL CONTINUE TO SERVE ON THE COMPANY'S OPERATING COMMITTEE."}